  "notes": [
    "Fully regular -AR verb; follows standard endings throughout",
    "Past participle: dudado (regular)",
    "Triggers the subjunctive: *dudar (de) que* + subjuntivo = to doubt that: *Dudo que sepa la respuesta* = I doubt he knows the answer",
    "*Dudar de* + noun/pronoun = to doubt something/someone: *Dudo de su honestidad* = I doubt his honesty",
    "*No dudar en* + infinitivo = to not hesitate to: *No dudes en llamarme* = Don't hesitate to call me",
    "Related: la duda (doubt), dudoso (doubtful, dubious), sin duda (without doubt, undoubtedly)"
  ],
